GAL16V8
CombTest

Clock A0   A1   A2    A3   NC   NC   NC	   NC	GND
/OE   SEGA SEGB SEGC  SEGD SEGE SEGF SEGG  NC	VCC

; Logic equations — active low (segment ON = pin LOW)
; We list the minterms where each segment is OFF.
;
; Segment OFF sets:
;   a OFF: 1,4,B,D
;   b OFF: 2,4,7,8,D
;   c OFF: 0,1,4,6,7,A,C
;   d OFF: 1,4,5,8,A,E
;   e OFF: 1,7,B,D
;   f OFF: 1,5,6,7,A,B,C,F
;   g OFF: 0,1,7

/SEGA =  A0

/SEGB =  A0

/SEGC =  A0

/SEGD =  A0

/SEGE =  A0

/SEGF =  A0

/SEGG =  A1


DESCRIPTION
7-segment hexadecimal decoder. Active-low outputs drive
common-anode LED display segments a through g.
